---
// Startseite EN. Der Jetski-Verleih ist zum August 2026 dauerhaft geschlossen,
// deshalb steht hier nur noch die Abschluss-Mitteilung.
//
// Die alte Marketing-Startseite liegt weiterhin in der Git-Historie
// (letzter Stand: Commit 751ffba) und in src/components/v2/* im Repo.
//
// DE-Pendant: src/pages/de/index.astro, Struktur 1:1 gleich halten.
import LayoutClosed from "../layouts/LayoutClosed.astro";
---

<LayoutClosed
  lang="en"
  title="Nero Lefkada · Permanently closed"
  description="Nero Lefkada, the Sea-Doo jetski rental at Lygia Port on Lefkada, has permanently closed. Bookings are no longer possible. Thank you to every guest who rode with us."
>
  <main>
    <p class="brand">Nero Lefkada</p>

    <h1>Permanently<br /><em>closed</em></h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>

    <p class="lead">
      After our seasons at Lygia Port, Nero Lefkada has closed for good.
      The jetski rental is no longer operating and bookings are not possible.
    </p>

    <p>
      Thank you to every guest who rode out with us into the Ionian.
      You made those summers what they were.
    </p>

    <p>
      For anything still open, write to
      <a href="mailto:nerolefkada@outlook.de">nerolefkada@outlook.de</a>.
    </p>

    <footer>
      <a href="/de/" hreflang="de" lang="de">Deutsch</a>
      <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
    </footer>

    <p class="legal">
      Nero Lefkada Rental and Retail Monoprosopi IKE<br />
      Closed since August 2026
    </p>
  </main>
</LayoutClosed>